      "content": "Your feelings of exhaustion and questioning the point of existence are valid experiences that many people grapple with, often feeling like life is just a routine of meaningless tasks. This mindset can signal a need to find small, genuine sources of joy or to explore deeper philosophical questions about purpose, rather than just ending things immediately. It is worth remembering that even brief moments of reflection or connection can sometimes shift this heavy, existential weight.",
